1
00:00:45,128 --> 00:00:47,130
Blood traces on the arrowhead.

2
00:00:48,047 --> 00:00:51,760
So Kamo's cursed technique
defies the laws of physics?

3
00:00:53,428 --> 00:00:56,890
You can summon another shikigami
at the same time, right?

4
00:00:57,474 --> 00:01:00,727
It doesn't feel nice
to know you're holding back.

5
00:01:01,436 --> 00:01:04,230
Divine Dog is busy at work.

6
00:01:05,065 --> 00:01:07,484
Likewise.
You're left with one arrow, right?

7
00:01:08,109 --> 00:01:10,445
I won't save you
even if you collapse from anemia.

8
00:01:11,780 --> 00:01:13,531
Blood Manipulation.

9
00:01:13,615 --> 00:01:16,576
It can control one's own blood
and objects attached to it.

10
00:01:17,202 --> 00:01:20,538
A fitting cursed technique
from one of the Great Families.

11
00:01:21,706 --> 00:01:23,166
Don't worry.

12
00:01:23,666 --> 00:01:26,878
I've prepared these in advance.

13
00:01:27,462 --> 00:01:29,172
Ten Shadows Technique.

14
00:01:29,672 --> 00:01:32,550
A cursed technique
passed down in the Zenin Family.

15
00:01:32,634 --> 00:01:35,595
One can summon ten shikigami
using shadows as a medium.

16
00:01:36,179 --> 00:01:39,224
If only Maki and Mai inherited it…

17
00:01:51,402 --> 00:01:53,446
Was he this strong?

18
00:01:55,698 --> 00:01:57,450
I didn't expect you to react to it.

19
00:01:58,493 --> 00:02:00,203
Don't let down your guard.

20
00:02:07,752 --> 00:02:09,671
My cursed energy defense was late.

21
00:02:10,171 --> 00:02:13,216
His speed and strength
are completely different from before.

22
00:02:15,260 --> 00:02:17,428
Blood Manipulation is not just about

23
00:02:17,512 --> 00:02:19,681
manipulating shapes or movement.

24
00:02:20,682 --> 00:02:22,809
It can even control body temperature,

25
00:02:22,892 --> 00:02:27,147
pulse rate,
and the number of red blood cells freely.

26
00:02:29,065 --> 00:02:30,608
Flowing Red Scale.

27
00:02:31,651 --> 00:02:33,027
Doping?

28
00:02:33,111 --> 00:02:34,571
Great observation.

29
00:02:35,071 --> 00:02:37,740
But please refrain from using that word.

30
00:04:16,422 --> 00:04:18,424
My katana

31
00:04:18,508 --> 00:04:22,178
Was taken away

32
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:26,683
I wonder where Mai's sister is.

33
00:04:26,766 --> 00:04:28,893
She's fast.

34
00:04:29,477 --> 00:04:34,691
Well, it's true that I won't be able
to fight without my katana.

35
00:04:35,566 --> 00:04:38,194
Is bubble tea really that good?

36
00:04:42,031 --> 00:04:43,241
It's Mechamaru.

37
00:04:44,951 --> 00:04:48,121
Hello. I'm Miwa, the useless one.

38
00:04:48,204 --> 00:04:49,539
Sleep.

39
00:04:52,542 --> 00:04:53,626
ULTIMATE MECHAMARU

40
00:04:54,460 --> 00:04:57,380
KYOTO SISTER-SCHOOL GOODWILL EVENT
KASUMI MIWA WITHDRAWS

41
00:05:01,467 --> 00:05:03,886
KASUMI MIWA

42
00:05:10,268 --> 00:05:11,311
Return.

43
00:05:26,409 --> 00:05:28,453
She fell asleep.

44
00:05:29,412 --> 00:05:30,872
I'll head over.

45
00:05:30,955 --> 00:05:31,789
What?

46
00:05:32,290 --> 00:05:36,044
I can't leave her in the forest
with Cursed Spirits, right?

47
00:05:41,841 --> 00:05:43,009
What is this?

48
00:05:43,593 --> 00:05:47,221
A Semi-Grade 1 Cursed Spirit
that will be released in the zone.

49
00:05:47,847 --> 00:05:50,058
Not a Grade 2 Cursed Spirit?

50
00:05:50,141 --> 00:05:53,102
A Grade 2 isn't assuring enough.

51
00:05:53,186 --> 00:05:54,145
What?

52
00:05:54,645 --> 00:05:58,191
Our own people are disorganized.

53
00:05:58,775 --> 00:06:02,195
This is the scent and whistle
used to control it.

54
00:06:02,779 --> 00:06:07,200
If possible, use it and kill Itadori.

55
00:06:07,283 --> 00:06:10,286
It might get eliminated before I use it.

56
00:06:10,787 --> 00:06:12,580
Don't worry.

57
00:06:12,663 --> 00:06:16,751
It's trained to not take action
before you sound the whistle.

58
00:06:19,295 --> 00:06:20,838
Kamo is good.

59
00:06:20,922 --> 00:06:22,924
He must have smeared the scent on Itadori

60
00:06:23,007 --> 00:06:26,636
when the video feed was disrupted.

61
00:06:27,428 --> 00:06:31,390
Once he mixes it in his blood,
then it will be easy.

62
00:06:33,101 --> 00:06:37,188
If Itadori is fighting Todo,
he won't get away with just a scratch.

63
00:06:37,271 --> 00:06:42,860
If the Semi-Grade 1 Cursed Spirit
attacks him after that…

64
00:06:42,944 --> 00:06:45,196
He would be dead for sure.

65
00:06:45,947 --> 00:06:47,323
That's right.

66
00:06:47,406 --> 00:06:51,285
I'm worried about Miwa too.
Hurry up and go.

67
00:06:59,210 --> 00:07:00,419
Kelp.

68
00:07:36,539 --> 00:07:39,792
Salmon, salmon roe, spiced cod roe.

69
00:07:44,255 --> 00:07:45,506
All right.

70
00:07:46,841 --> 00:07:49,051
We should get to work too.

71
00:07:49,802 --> 00:07:51,804
Let's make a clothing rack.

72
00:07:51,888 --> 00:07:54,724
Satoru Gojo's at least 190cm tall, right?

73
00:07:54,807 --> 00:07:57,727
He'll make a good clothing rack.

74
00:08:11,277 --> 00:08:14,447
Why does everyone bully you, Mother?

75
00:08:15,448 --> 00:08:18,117
Because I'm an illegitimate mistress.

76
00:08:18,201 --> 00:08:21,454
Then why take special care of me?

77
00:08:22,079 --> 00:08:24,707
Why bring me here pretending
that I'm the eldest son?

78
00:08:25,208 --> 00:08:27,877
Because his wife
couldn't give birth to a son

79
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:30,630
capable of inheriting
his cursed technique.

80
00:08:31,214 --> 00:08:34,759
Then as the next head of the Kamo Family…

81
00:09:06,916 --> 00:09:11,128
It's rare to find a shikigami user
who's flexible in close combat.

82
00:09:11,212 --> 00:09:12,797
You've improved.

83
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:14,340
I'm happy for you.

84
00:09:14,924 --> 00:09:18,344
Why are you acting familiar with me
from time to time?

85
00:09:18,928 --> 00:09:20,846
It's sympathy.

86
00:09:20,930 --> 00:09:24,600
You'll be the pillar supporting
the Great Families in the future.

87
00:09:27,436 --> 00:09:30,648
I'm going to kill Yuji Itadori.

88
00:09:32,483 --> 00:09:34,860
Is that Principal Gakuganji's order?

89
00:09:35,611 --> 00:09:38,531
No, it's my own will.

90
00:09:38,614 --> 00:09:41,450
As a member of the Kamo Family,

91
00:09:41,534 --> 00:09:43,953
I think this is the right decision.

92
00:09:45,413 --> 00:09:49,166
I must act and behave like
the eldest son of the Kamo Family.

93
00:09:50,001 --> 00:09:51,460
It's for Mother's sake.

94
00:09:52,920 --> 00:09:55,006
You should understand it too.

95
00:09:55,965 --> 00:09:58,217
Because we're the same.

96
00:09:59,218 --> 00:10:00,511
No way.

97
00:10:01,012 --> 00:10:02,972
He's saying some scary stuff suddenly.

98
00:10:04,432 --> 00:10:05,891
It's true.

99
00:10:05,975 --> 00:10:07,852
No, it's not.

100
00:10:07,935 --> 00:10:10,479
Tell that to Maki.

101
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:15,401
I'm no longer connected
to the Zenin Family.

102
00:10:16,193 --> 00:10:20,239
Besides, I don't think I'm right.

103
00:10:20,990 --> 00:10:22,658
No, sorry.

104
00:10:23,159 --> 00:10:24,368
It's wrong.

105
00:10:24,952 --> 00:10:28,748
It doesn't matter
whether I'm right or not.

106
00:10:29,790 --> 00:10:33,502
I only believe in my own conscience.

107
00:10:34,712 --> 00:10:37,715
Helping others
according to my own conscience.

108
00:10:39,133 --> 00:10:42,803
If someone denies me of that…

109
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:48,684
All that's left is to curse that person.

110
00:10:51,520 --> 00:10:52,938
A Shikigami?

111
00:10:54,148 --> 00:10:55,650
There was one left?

112
00:10:57,860 --> 00:11:00,154
It was about to run out,
and he used it as bait?

113
00:11:02,490 --> 00:11:06,243
This one consumes a lot of cursed energy
and can only be used alone.

114
00:11:06,327 --> 00:11:08,788
I just purified it recently.

115
00:11:09,872 --> 00:11:11,040
Max Elephant.

116
00:11:20,383 --> 00:11:21,967
That's a huge target.

117
00:11:22,051 --> 00:11:23,052
I must act first!

118
00:11:27,098 --> 00:11:28,015
Water?

119
00:11:30,976 --> 00:11:33,104
I'm swept away
by the water and its pressure!

120
00:11:33,187 --> 00:11:34,563
It's dangerous in a wide area.

121
00:11:34,647 --> 00:11:36,107
He'll use that trick.

122
00:11:40,694 --> 00:11:41,612
Nue.

123
00:11:50,788 --> 00:11:54,291
I'll only hinder you if I'm around.

124
00:11:54,834 --> 00:11:56,043
I…

125
00:11:56,794 --> 00:11:58,462
Blood Manipulation!

126
00:12:02,508 --> 00:12:03,884
Crimson Binding!

127
00:12:06,762 --> 00:12:09,974
I'm not going to lose!

128
00:12:12,893 --> 00:12:13,811
-What?
-What?

129
00:12:15,396 --> 00:12:16,730
What's that?

130
00:12:18,441 --> 00:12:19,733
Inumaki!

131
00:12:20,943 --> 00:12:22,486
Run away now!

132
00:12:31,662 --> 00:12:32,580
What?

133
00:12:32,663 --> 00:12:33,581
What?

134
00:12:34,415 --> 00:12:35,374
What…

135
00:12:36,834 --> 00:12:38,711
Has the game ended?

136
00:12:38,794 --> 00:12:40,671
And they are all red flames…

137
00:12:41,672 --> 00:12:45,259
That's weird.
The crows didn't see anything.

138
00:12:46,719 --> 00:12:49,180
I wish I could say
that they were exorcised by

139
00:12:49,263 --> 00:12:51,849
the Great Teacher Gojo's students…

140
00:12:51,932 --> 00:12:55,853
An unregistered cursed energy
ignites a red flame as well.

141
00:12:56,437 --> 00:13:00,191
Outsiders? You mean intruders?

142
00:13:00,691 --> 00:13:03,903
Has Master Tengen's barrier failed?

143
00:13:03,986 --> 00:13:06,864
Intruders or not,

144
00:13:06,947 --> 00:13:09,867
this is still an emergency.

145
00:13:10,659 --> 00:13:14,622
Being able to eliminate that
means the opponent's quite strong.

146
00:13:15,456 --> 00:13:16,957
Who could it be?

147
00:13:18,292 --> 00:13:20,419
I'll go see Master Tengen.

148
00:13:21,670 --> 00:13:24,590
Satoru, protect Principal Gakuganji
and the students.

149
00:13:24,673 --> 00:13:28,344
Mei Mei, stay here and locate the students

150
00:13:28,427 --> 00:13:31,472
and then report it to Satoru
and the others.

151
00:13:31,555 --> 00:13:33,307
Understood.

152
00:13:33,390 --> 00:13:35,601
I look forward to the bonus.

153
00:13:36,936 --> 00:13:38,729
Come on, Grandpa!

154
00:13:38,812 --> 00:13:40,606
It's time for a walk.

155
00:13:40,689 --> 00:13:42,942
You've eaten lunch just now, right?

156
00:13:44,944 --> 00:13:46,237
Let's hurry.

157
00:13:58,541 --> 00:13:59,542
What?

158
00:14:06,632 --> 00:14:07,716
What?

159
00:14:08,717 --> 00:14:10,803
What a big fuss.

160
00:14:11,387 --> 00:14:16,892
However, when Cursed Spirits die,
nothing else remains.

161
00:14:17,977 --> 00:14:22,273
Nothing can be made out of it.

162
00:14:25,234 --> 00:14:27,278
Will this do?

163
00:14:27,862 --> 00:14:29,905
Right, and that too.

164
00:14:31,365 --> 00:14:35,035
"Emerge from darkness,
that which is darker than black."

165
00:14:35,119 --> 00:14:37,872
"Purify this impurity."

166
00:14:41,417 --> 00:14:43,502
All right!

167
00:14:44,336 --> 00:14:48,257
I look forward to the clothing rack.

168
00:15:09,069 --> 00:15:11,238
A Veil? Why is it appearing now?

169
00:15:13,282 --> 00:15:14,408
Gojo!

170
00:15:14,491 --> 00:15:17,494
Go in first before the Veil fully forms!

171
00:15:17,995 --> 00:15:20,080
-No, I can't do that.
-What?

172
00:15:20,581 --> 00:15:22,917
Actually, the Veil
has been formed completely.

173
00:15:23,417 --> 00:15:26,921
It seems to prioritize effects
over visual.

174
00:15:27,421 --> 00:15:28,547
They are good.

175
00:15:34,094 --> 00:15:37,222
Well, since it has been set up,

176
00:15:37,306 --> 00:15:38,974
I just need to tear it apart.

177
00:15:45,814 --> 00:15:48,275
What's this strange feeling?

178
00:15:48,359 --> 00:15:49,902
Wait a minute.

179
00:15:50,486 --> 00:15:54,907
Why were you pushed back, but not me?

180
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:01,455
I see.

181
00:16:03,207 --> 00:16:06,001
Utahime and Grandpa.

182
00:16:06,085 --> 00:16:07,378
This Veil…

183
00:16:08,003 --> 00:16:11,131
is made specifically
to keep Satoru Gojo out

184
00:16:11,215 --> 00:16:14,718
while letting other sorcerers
enter and leave.

185
00:16:15,219 --> 00:16:16,387
What?

186
00:16:17,179 --> 00:16:20,224
He's right. That makes sense.

187
00:16:20,724 --> 00:16:24,728
But for someone to set up
a specific barrier like this means that…

188
00:16:25,229 --> 00:16:27,856
They are highly-skilled Curse Users.

189
00:16:28,357 --> 00:16:31,986
Not only that, but he also has a fair
amount of information on Jujutsu High.

190
00:16:33,070 --> 00:16:34,780
Come on. Hurry up and go.

191
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:37,282
We don't know about their objective,

192
00:16:37,366 --> 00:16:39,910
but it's our loss if someone dies.

193
00:16:48,419 --> 00:16:51,046
What a strong curse aura!

194
00:16:51,130 --> 00:16:53,757
Don't tell me
a Special Grade Curse Spirit is here.

195
00:16:53,841 --> 00:16:56,343
Hey.

196
00:16:56,427 --> 00:16:59,346
Hey!

197
00:16:59,972 --> 00:17:02,808
Satoru Gojo isn't here!

198
00:17:03,642 --> 00:17:05,102
A Curse User?

199
00:17:05,185 --> 00:17:07,229
He's not the master of this aura,

200
00:17:07,312 --> 00:17:09,815
but he's quite strong.

201
00:17:10,399 --> 00:17:13,819
How dare that stupid monk lie to me.

202
00:17:13,902 --> 00:17:16,613
Utahime, you may continue on first.

203
00:17:16,697 --> 00:17:21,201
Prioritize the students' safety
and try to avoid a fight.

204
00:17:22,536 --> 00:17:27,124
Wait a minute.
Let me kill that woman at least!

205
00:17:27,207 --> 00:17:31,462
I can't make anything with an old man's
brittle bones and wrinkled skin!

206
00:17:33,130 --> 00:17:35,466
Whether I have brittle bones or not…

207
00:17:37,760 --> 00:17:40,637
You can confirm it by killing me!

208
00:17:41,221 --> 00:17:45,559
Come back after
drinking your milk, old man.

209
00:17:55,694 --> 00:17:58,155
Why would a Cursed Spirit be in school?

210
00:17:58,238 --> 00:17:59,782
Who cast this Veil?

211
00:18:00,449 --> 00:18:03,285
Probably a Curse User
who cooperates with Cursed Spirits.

212
00:18:05,204 --> 00:18:06,663
You know something?

213
00:18:07,790 --> 00:18:10,626
These are unregistered
Special Grade Curses.

214
00:18:10,709 --> 00:18:13,754
It seems like
they are cooperating with humans.

215
00:18:14,379 --> 00:18:18,634
I think it might be the Special Grade
Cursed Spirit that attacked Mr. Gojo.

216
00:18:19,134 --> 00:18:21,261
Even its appearance fits the report.

217
00:18:22,304 --> 00:18:24,556
I can tell even with his drawing.

218
00:18:27,392 --> 00:18:28,393
You're right.

219
00:18:28,894 --> 00:18:30,646
Let's contact Mr. Gojo.

220
00:18:31,146 --> 00:18:32,564
Wait a minute.

221
00:18:33,232 --> 00:18:36,443
You can understand him?

222
00:18:36,527 --> 00:18:38,612
That's not important right now.

223
00:18:39,279 --> 00:18:41,657
The opponent might know
how to use a Domain.

224
00:18:41,740 --> 00:18:44,451
We have to stay away and retreat--

225
00:18:48,205 --> 00:18:49,665
Stop!

226
00:18:54,336 --> 00:18:56,171
Blood Manipulation…

227
00:18:56,672 --> 00:18:57,548
Slicing Exorcism!

228
00:19:01,260 --> 00:19:02,678
It's not effective at all?

229
00:19:12,563 --> 00:19:15,065
Its skin is really tough!

230
00:19:17,192 --> 00:19:18,193
That katana…

231
00:19:19,361 --> 00:19:21,488
Where was he hiding it?

232
00:19:25,784 --> 00:19:28,745
Stop it, foolish children.

233
00:19:31,081 --> 00:19:32,332
What's this?

234
00:19:32,416 --> 00:19:36,044
It's speaking in a foreign language,
but I can understand it.

235
00:19:36,587 --> 00:19:38,422
This feels gross.

236
00:19:39,047 --> 00:19:43,177
I merely wish to protect this planet.

237
00:19:43,760 --> 00:19:46,388
Don't listen to its nonsense.

238
00:19:46,889 --> 00:19:49,933
It's not the same as those
low-level Cursed Spirits.

239
00:19:51,018 --> 00:19:53,395
The forest, ocean, and sky…

240
00:19:53,478 --> 00:19:56,148
They cry out in pain,
saying they can't bear it anymore.

241
00:19:56,815 --> 00:20:00,444
They can no longer coexist with humans.

242
00:20:01,195 --> 00:20:05,741
They know that some humans
are kind to this planet,

243
00:20:05,824 --> 00:20:09,411
but how much can that kindness
make up for?

244
00:20:10,621 --> 00:20:13,457
It has its own language system.

245
00:20:14,166 --> 00:20:17,961
All they want is time.

246
00:20:19,129 --> 00:20:20,797
Ask Inumaki to retreat.

247
00:20:22,257 --> 00:20:27,221
If there's enough time,
this planet can shine again.

248
00:20:36,605 --> 00:20:39,233
A time without humans.

249
00:20:40,525 --> 00:20:43,570
Die, and become a sage.

250
00:22:16,788 --> 00:22:18,373
-Juju Stroll.
-Juju Stroll.

251
00:22:22,085 --> 00:22:24,379
Hey, Jogo!

252
00:22:25,172 --> 00:22:27,674
You burned Hanami's flower bed again!

253
00:22:27,758 --> 00:22:29,760
Hanami is crying.

254
00:22:36,099 --> 00:22:37,517
Hanami.

255
00:22:37,601 --> 00:22:41,146
Why don't we just kill Jogo?

256
00:22:41,730 --> 00:22:47,235
My boyfriend's senior
is in that line of business.

257
00:22:47,819 --> 00:22:50,238
No, it's not that serious.

258
00:23:16,515 --> 00:23:18,350
Is this…

259
00:23:18,433 --> 00:23:19,935
slash-and-burn farming?

260
00:23:20,435 --> 00:23:24,731
Was it because the old soil
had insufficient nutrients?

261
00:23:39,913 --> 00:23:41,373
My heart is touched.
